> When entering a shop that has a ghost level,  I sometimes cannot pay 
> for the items (what a shame).  It tells me "program in disorder, you'd
> better quit.  Normally this happens when I have gray dragon scale mail, 
> Mjollnir, or some other really sexy artifact.  So I never quit.  I am 
> allowed to walk out of the shop,  with items listed as "unpaided".

You can often get away with not quitting when the "program is in disorder";
a lot of times the problem is confined to one level (in this case, the
ghost level with the shop). It is a good idea to make a backup copy at
that point, if you can (e.g. if you're running a PC or Mac version).
